  "abstract": "{\"business_domain\":[\"巨量营销-建站与落地页\"],\"business_line\":[\"巨量营销\"],\"capability_summary\":\"用户可以实现站点的转赠功能，将某一客户的站点复制给其他特定的客户，转赠成功后，被转增的投放账户下会新增一个站点id（内容同原站点），但会清空原站点下的资产信息。需配合【获取Access-Token】接口获取授权access-token，应答返回码和信息详见【附录-返回码】文档。\",\"id\":\"ad.site.handsel\",\"interface_path\":\"/open_api/2/tools/site/handsel/\",\"method\":\"POST\",\"official_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/markdown/get/?language=CHINESE\\u0026doc_id=1696710623352844\",\"related_docs\":[{\"id\":\"get.access-token\",\"path\":\"\",\"reason\":\"请求此接口需要授权access-token，需通过该接口获取\",\"relation\":\"前置接口\",\"title\":\"获取Access-Token\"},{\"id\":\"appendix.return-code\",\"path\":\"\",\"reason\":\"应答的返回码和信息需要参考该文档\",\"relation\":\"配合文档\",\"title\":\"附录-返回码\"}],\"risk_level\":\"medium\",\"schema_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/schema/markdown/get/?doc_id=1696710623352844\",\"title\":\"建站工具-建站样式复制（跨账户）\"}",
